steps.prompt:
Design the lab described here:

{{brief}}

Write the spec into .kiro/specs/{{lab_name}}/ (requirements.md, design.md, tasks.md). Use the labkit MCP tools (list_labs, list_catalog) before designing. Do not write any implementation code.

Implement the lab specified here:

{{design.output}}

Create app-{{lab_name}}/ (config.json, lab.js, index.html), add it to scripts/build-standalone.mjs and to the portal index.html, and add the matching property to tests/properties-labs.mjs named after its requirement. Never edit core/ unless the spec asks for a schema extension. Then run: node scripts/validate-config.mjs, node tests/run-tests.mjs, node scripts/build-standalone.mjs.

Apply the fixes requested by the reviewers (joined review output below).

{{previous.output}}

Fix only what the reviews flag. Then run node scripts/validate-config.mjs, node tests/run-tests.mjs and node scripts/build-standalone.mjs. If a review point is wrong, say why and skip it.
